// Single source of truth for the documentation package.
//
// Every surface (window, page, dialog, menu, native dialog, context menu,
// command line) and every control on it is listed here ONCE. From this file:
//   build_inventory.js  -> ui_inventory.json (adds verified file:line for each entry)
//   capture.js          -> which controls get a numbered callout on which screenshot
//   build_manual.js     -> the callout tables in USER_MANUAL
//
// `find` is the literal text searched for in `file` to resolve the line number.
// For controls with an id, `find` defaults to id="<id>" in src/renderer/index.html.
// Keep wording in full words; no abbreviations in names.

